# Groups past a limit return before a barrier that the other groups reach: 6 groups, 4 of them stay; the output of the other two is
# the random initial content, identical for every compiler.
case group_return_barrier
shader compute/group_return_barrier.hlsl
dispatch CSMain 6 1 1
uniform 0 0 : 4u 7u 0u 0u
storage 0 1 out size=1536 : @u32(31,384)
